					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071804,
					"content": "Is this not precisely the meaning of love!? Truly, the power of love transcends all boundaries!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071805,
					"content": "I, for one, have nothing but the utmost respect for both of them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071806,
					"content": "But especially for the fish. It knew full well that the object of its affection was a cat, yet still it chose to bare its soul and express its true feelings unreservedly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071807,
					"content": "I'm glad you got to pay your respects.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071808
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 221071808,
					"content": "What do you mean? ...Oh. The fish is right here... You brought it with you!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071809,
					"content": "So you just kidnapped this poor fish while its helpless feline friend watched in horror?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071810,
					"content": "What kind of person witnesses an incredibly rare case of inter-species friendship... and then bursts in to tear them apart!? You're supposed to protect things like that, you moron!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071811,
					"content": "And all that aside — this would've been the perfect sign, but you just had to ruin it, didn't you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071812,
					"content": "Ugh. Please, I'm begging you, just leave me alone. I need some time to myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				}
			]
		},
