					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071903,
					"content": "Wait, what? Those doggies looked like the best of friends...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071904,
					"content": "I know that group of dogs. They are indeed friendly to one another, and they stick together all year round.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071905,
					"content": "That might sound like a good thing, but the fact is... None of those dogs has ever found a mate.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221071906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhihua"
				},
				{
					"id": 221071906,
					"content": "And because they are surrounded by friends all the time, they just aren't bothered by it.",
